# Parent / integration branch

The **parent branch** for this project is **`dev/2025-2026-senior-project`**.

- Create feature branches from `dev/2025-2026-senior-project` (e.g. `git checkout dev/2025-2026-senior-project && git pull && git checkout -b feature/...`).
- When merging completed work, merge **into** `dev/2025-2026-senior-project`, not into `main`.
- When checking for merge conflicts or discussing integration, use `dev/2025-2026-senior-project` as the target branch.

Example after finishing a feature:
```bash
git checkout dev/2025-2026-senior-project
git pull origin dev/2025-2026-senior-project
git merge feature/your-feature-name
# resolve any conflicts, then push
git push origin dev/2025-2026-senior-project
```
